    "sections": {
        "description": "Travel Camping is a clean and modern WordPress theme designed for camping sites, travel agencies, outdoor adventure businesses, trekking groups, tour operators, hiking clubs, and nature-focused blogs. Its responsive layout helps your website look great on desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. The theme includes a welcoming banner section, service areas, destination highlights, trip packages, image galleries, testimonials, blog layouts, and contact details. You can showcase camping tours, hiking experiences, outdoor activities, travel guides, and special offers in a clear and engaging way. Travel Camping is easy to customise through the WordPress Customizer, allowing you to update colours, fonts, logos, menus, and homepage sections to suit your brand. With a simple layout and user-friendly navigation, it helps visitors explore your services and plan their next outdoor journey."
    },
